60,3,1,talk,Mio,,"I'm really torn! The Coastal Lodge sounds lovely, but those non-refundable deposits and high transport costs are scary. Still, the other options sound like a total mess for our sleep and sanity!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,1,talk,Shizue,,"I believe the Coastal Lodge is our best choice. To keep our members from drifting away, we must prioritize a place where everyone stays together and bonds in the evenings.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The Campus Intensive is too labor-intensive for organizers, and the Mountain Training Centre is an administrative nightmare. The Coastal Lodge is the only logical choice to ensure the camp's quality and the organizers' well-being.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge! I can't do eight people to a room or training at midnight. I need a real bed and some peace so I can actually train!,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,"The Coastal Lodge is too risky financially. Between the transport costs and the non-refundable deposits, we're inviting another deficit. I believe the Mountain Training Centre is the most fiscally responsible choice for the club.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"I don't want to risk the budget, but the Mountain Training Centre sounds like a nightmare for sleep. If everyone else wants the lodge, maybe we can just be really strict about the headcount?","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Shizue,,"That is a wonderful idea, Mio. If we support one another and commit to the trip, we can ensure no one is left behind and everyone feels welcome in our shared home.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
67,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Strict headcounts and clear commitments can mitigate the financial risks. Given the alternatives are either an administrative disaster or a burden on the staff, the lodge remains the only viable option for a successful camp.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
68,3,2,talk,Rin,,Exactly! Let's just make sure everyone promises to go. I'd rather pay a bit more than be a zombie for four days! The lodge is definitely the way to go!,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"Strict promises don't fix a budget deficit. If we choose the lodge, we are gambling with the club's funds. The Mountain Training Centre is affordable and avoids the cooking burden of the campus option.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,"I'm still worried about the money, but I can't ignore how bad the other options sound. If we all agree to be careful, I'll go with the Coastal Lodge!","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Shizue,,It warms my heart to see us reaching an agreement. Let us choose the Coastal Lodge to ensure our members bond and feel a true sense of belonging together.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The logic is clear. The other options fail on both administrative and practical grounds. To protect the organizers and the quality of training, the Coastal Lodge is the only reasonable choice. I vote for Option C.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Rin,,I'm voting for the Coastal Lodge too! I can't imagine sleeping in a room with seven other people. Let's go for Option C and actually get some sleep!,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I cannot support a choice that risks the club's financial stability. The Coastal Lodge is far too expensive and rigid. I vote for Option B, the Mountain Training Centre, to keep costs low.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
75,3,4,talk,Mio,,"I've thought about it, and I can't let the budget fail again. But I also can't support a place where we can't sleep! I'll take the risk and vote for Option C!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
76,3,4,talk,Shizue,,I shall also cast my vote for Option C. Let us prioritize the heart of our club and create a space where every member feels they truly belong.,"{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
