78,3,4,talk,Rin,,I'm definitely voting for Option C! I want a place where we can actually rest and have fun together. Coastal Lodge it is!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
79,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I cannot in good conscience vote for a destination that puts our finances at such high risk. I maintain my vote for Option B to ensure we stay within a sustainable budget.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
